Subject: [PATCH v11 05/11] ext4: refactor dx_root to support variable dirent sizes
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:50:35 -0400
Message-ID: <20260731235043.44068-6-ablagodarenko@thelustrecollective.com>
